# Scanner CSV Ingestion & Manifest Export Rules

- Auto-detect scanner source by header signature and normalize to `{ scryfallId, setCode, collectorNumber, finish, condition, quantity }`.
- **ManaBox:** Read `Scryfall ID` directly. Map `Foil` (`normal`, `foil`, `etched`). Map `Condition` (`near_mint`->`NM`, `lightly_played`->`LP`, `moderately_played`->`MP`, `heavily_played`->`HP`, `damaged`->`DMG`).
- **Delver Lens:** Read `Scryfall ID`. Normalize `Foil` boolean/string.
- **TCGplayer App:** Match `Product ID` against `card_catalog.tcgplayer_id` (or `tcgplayer_etched_id`). Fallback to `(LOWER(Set Code), Card Number)`.
- **Card Conduit Export Validation:** Ensure >= 90% of total quantity has `P_buy >= 0.50` before exporting Curated/Sorted CSVs.
